{
    "title": "Escape Giant Obby",
    "description": "Looking for an addictive and challenging obby puzzle game? Look no further than Escape Obby Bobby- the ultimate stealth adventure obby game.\r\n\r\nWith its colorful and engaging graphics, \"Escape Obby Bobby'\" offers an immersive gaming experience that will keep you entertained for hours on end. Each level presents new challenges that require you to think creatively and stay one step ahead of the day-care staff.\r\n\r\nAre you ready to jump into Obby Bobby? Let's get to it! This obby game isn't like the others, it is patrolled by a GIANT Obby and has some of the world's best security technology designed to stop you from escaping! Make your way through jumps, chases, and defeat Obby Bobby in an epic boss battle. Let's do this!\r\n\r\nEscape Obby Bobby's game is the ultimate combination of puzzle and stealth gameplay. So put on your thinking cap and get ready for an adventure - download it now and see if you have what it takes to break out of day-care!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for an addictive and challenging obby puzzle game? Look no further than Escape Obby Bobby- the ultimate stealth adventure obby game.<br><br>With its colorful and engaging graphics, &quot;Escape Obby Bobby&#39;&quot; offers an immersive gaming experience that will keep you entertained for hours on end. Each level presents new challenges that require you to think creatively and stay one step ahead of the day-care staff.<br><br>Are you ready to jump into Obby Bobby? Let&#39;s get to it! This obby game isn&#39;t like the others, it is patrolled by a GIANT Obby and has some of the world&#39;s best security technology designed to stop you from escaping! Make your way through jumps, chases, and defeat Obby Bobby in an epic boss battle. Let&#39;s do this!<br><br>Escape Obby Bobby&#39;s game is the ultimate combination of puzzle and stealth gameplay. So put on your thinking cap and get ready for an adventure - download it now and see if you have what it takes to break out of day-care!",
    "summary": "You've been dropped off at Giant Bobby's it's up to you to find a way out",
